         TITLE 'RACINIT PROCESS. (GET INTO/OUT OF SYSTEM) - BUILD ACEE' 00055600
RACIACEE LA    R2,255              PRE-FILL WITH LSQA SUBPOOL           00055700
         TM    3(R8),X'10'         S.P. SPEC?                           00055800
