         B     RACIGOOD            OK ..........                        00062700
RACINSTA EQU   *                                                        00062800
         L     R2,PSAAOLD          ADDRESS ASCB                         00062900
         L     R2,ASCBASXB-ASCB(R2) ADDRESS ASCB                        00063000
         ST    ACEEREG,ASXBSENV-ASXB(R2) STORE IN ASXB                  00063100
