         DROP  R4                                                       00063400
         TITLE 'RACINIT PROCESS. (GET INTO/OUT OF SYSTEM) - DEL. ACEE'  00063500
RACINDEL ICM   R2,B'1111',X'34'(R8) ACEE PTR                            00063600
